her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003440\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003441\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003443\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015583\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015584\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000082\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000488\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"87004e42-c4bd-4468-8b83-00f122c59dd9\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007316\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008328\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007533\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":197,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000560\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002207\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002294\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005786\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17711\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000042\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000349\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000696\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002427\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000010\",\"0000000011\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a4cb369f-77c4-4fe1-8f85-dd5e76b195dd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007533\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008563\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007929\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Nuremberg\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the immediate aftermath of the Second World War, as the world grapples with the unveiled horrors of the Holocaust, U.S. Army psychiatrist Lt. Col. Douglas Kelley (Rami Malek) is assigned the extraordinary task of assessing the mental state of Hermann Göring (Russell Crowe), the notorious former Reichsmarschall and Hitler’s second in command, along with other high ranking Nazi officials.\\nAs the Allies – led by the unyielding chief U.S. prosecutor, Supreme Court Justice Robert H. Jackson (Michael Shannon) alongside Sgt. Howie Triest (Leo Woodall), David Maxwell-Fyfe (Richard E. Grant), Gustave Gilbert (Colin Hanks), Col. John Amen (Mark O’Brien) and Burton C. Andrus (John Slattery) – navigate the monumental task of creating an unprecedented international tribunal to ensure the Nazi regime answers for its atrocities, Kelley gets to know his ‘patients’. But he soon finds himself locked in a psychological duel with Göring, whose charisma and cunning reveal a sobering truth: that ordinary men can commit extraordinary evil.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The Allies, led by the unyielding chief prosecutor, Robert H. Jackson (Michael Shannon), have the task of ensuring the Nazi regime answers for the unveiled horrors.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"images of real dead bodies, Holocaust references, strong violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":148,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004231\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004232\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004687\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014229\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015883\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016789\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016790\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016791\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016793\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016794\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016795\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016796\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016797\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000147\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000997\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001323\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001785\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002222\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000013\",\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"f015523e-e189-4198-a6f8-cf6f63968b64\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007929\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009001\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-22\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdDdlY2VPxw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012707\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016977\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000031\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001305\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"dc7be94d-5ba5-4a79-accd-48ed4d19a3b6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009092\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"LIONSGATE INTERNATIONAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008080\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003903\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011027\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017134\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000321\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000322\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001794\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001974\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000005\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"37b2b94f-65a0-481e-9d3c-bde2445c99a4\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008080\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009165\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008101\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, injury detail, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":150,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s9gSuKaKcqM\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001370\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012950\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014188\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014753\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017170\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017171\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17172\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17173\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17174\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008177\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Giant\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the remarkable true story of legendary British-Yemeni boxing champion Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed and his relationship with Irish boxing trainer Brendan Ingle, GIANT charts Naz’s inspiring rags-to-riches underdog tale from his humble beginnings in Sheffield to becoming champion of the world.\\n\\nWith his unorthodox style, cocky persona and sheer dominance of the sport, Naseem faced down the abhorrent racism and islamophobia that swept Britain in the 80’s and 90’s, to become a global sporting icon, both inside and outside of the ring.\\n\\nThe film explores the unlikely and tender relationship between Naz and his trainer Ingle – a steel industry worker who ran a humble boxing gym in a church hall in the North of England; and the instrumental role that Ingle played on Naz’s road to success. With exhilarating and visceral scenes in the ring, coupled with deeply moving and intimate moments behind the curtain, GIANT is an inspiring biopic of one of the greatest showmen the sporting world has even seen – the untold true story of the boy behind The Prince.\\n\\nPierce Brosnan (James Bond franchise, Mamma Mia!, The Love Punch, Mobland) stars as Brendan Ingle, with Amir El-Masry (The Night Manager, Limbo, The Crown, SAS: Rogue Heroes) playing Naseem Hamed. From executive producer Sylvester Stallone (Rocky, Creed), GIANT is written and directed by film-maker Rowan Athale (Gangs of London).\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The remarkable real-life story of legendary British-Yemeni boxer Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, discrimination\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iUYO2kk1Fek\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000949\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003156\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017331\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017333\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001836\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000023\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"1c43a4ae-d161-4502-9f9e-6ae2973ddcd3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008177\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009268\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"True Brit Entertainment LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014577\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"12790418-6492-492a-814c-53673bc1ab1a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008189\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009281\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008191\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"cas