v=i39w-wDZZuU\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003230\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010191\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017391\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017392\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000898\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001025\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001027\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001190\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001796\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000018\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"53bcf89b-c3eb-481c-9b0e-65563daec337\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008205\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009298\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WARNER BROS DISTRIBUTORS LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008402\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Dalej jazda 2\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In \\\"Dalej Jazda 2\\\", the senior couple Joziek and Ela Gugulak decide to take the next big step in their long life together — they plan to get married after decades of shared adventures. However, what starts as simple wedding preparations quickly turns into a series of unexpected and humorous twists: the bride mysteriously goes missing, prompting an impromptu journey through the family’s past, and the Gugulaks are thrown into unpredictable situations that test their resilience, love, and bond with family members. Alongside them, younger relatives face their own emotional and romantic challenges, bringing together generations in a warm, funny and heartfelt story about family, love, and the surprises life still has in store. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In \\\"Dalej Jazda 2\\\", the senior couple Joziek and Ela Gugulak decide to take the next big step in their long life together — they plan to get married after decades.\",\"